i" data-ved="2ahUKEwj299TbuaCXAxXdqVYBHedOEL8Q-7AUegYIAAgnEAA" data-hveid="CAAIJxAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MqCf6d_5j" data-hveid="CAAIJxAB" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MqCf6d_5k" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><div class="JWCOje" data-processed="true"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MqCf6d_5l" data-hveid="CAAIJxAC" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MqCf6d_5m" data-complete="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MqCf6d_5n" data-complete="true">특징:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> 비행시간이 약 4시간 30분으로 비교적 짧고, 훌륭한 리조트를 합리적인 가격에 누릴 수 있는 <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MqCf6d_5o" data-complete="true">최고의 가성비 휴양지<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>입니다.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MqCf6d_5p" data-complete="true"><div class="JWCOje"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MqCf6d_5q" data-hveid="CAAIJxAD" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MqCf6d_5r" data-complete="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MqCf6d_5s" data-complete="true">분위기:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> 깔끔하게 정돈된 미케 비치 해변을 따라 고급 리조트들이 늘어서 있으며, 음식이