action="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1c" data-complete="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1d" data-complete="true">관심사:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> 무조건적인 휴식, 스파/마사지, 맛있는 음식, 리조트 콕<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1e" data-complete="true"><div class="JWCOje"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1f" data-hveid="CAAICxAG" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1g" data-complete="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1h" data-complete="true">동행자:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> 연인 또는 부부 (2인 기준)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1i" data-complete="true"><div class="JWCOje"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1j" data-hveid="CAAICxAH" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1k" data-complete="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1l" data-complete="true">이동수단:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> 프라이빗 프라이빗 드라이버 차량 (일일 렌트), 픽업 서비스<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1m" data-complete="true"><div class="JWCOje"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1n" data-hveid="CAAICxAI" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1o" data-complete="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1p" data-complete="true">숙소 선호:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> 5성급 럭셔리 풀빌라 및 디자인 리조트<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1q" data-complete="true"><div class="JWCOje"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1r" data-hveid="CAAICxAJ" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1s" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><div class="JWCOje" data-processed="true"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;KIrvnb_1t|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1t" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><hr class="s6NV4e" jsaction="" jscontroller="gWGJ0d#iOlsLd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1u" data-sfc-pl="|||[]" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style=""><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;KIrvnb_1v|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1v" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="otQkpb" aria-level="3" role="heading" data-animation-nesting="" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" data-wiz-attrbind="aria-level=KIrvnb_1w/fLk2Md" jscontroller="a7qCn#ZxCkTb" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1w" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style="">🗺️ 한눈에 보는 동선 (전체 일정)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1x" data-hveid="CAAIDhAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">발리 응우라라이 국제공항(DPS)에 도착해 트렌디한 <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1y" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">스미냑 해변에서 2박<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>을 보내며 바다를 즐기고, 남은 <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_1z" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">2박은 울창한 우붓 정글<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> 속 풀빌라에서 완벽한 프라이빗 플런지를 즐기는 힐링 코스입니다.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;KIrvnb_20|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_20" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="K1VDmd" jsuid="KIrvnb_21" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;KIrvnb_21|npT2md" jscontroller="XWsOs#xC5Tyf" data-sfc-root="ep" data-wiz-uids="KIrvnb_22,KIrvnb_23" data-ctx-cb-provider="xalEqe:TZ1N6" data-ved="2ahUKEwia_t-FuqCXAxVFsFYBHTi9H0cQ6OkTegYIAAgPEAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2" style=""><div class="bOa5M aYvns" jsname="loading-container" aria-busy="true" jsuid="KIrvnb_22" data-processed="true"><div jsuid="KIrvnb_24" class="Pi41gf" jsaction="mapTilesLoaded:&amp;KIrvnb_24|ZUljYd;rcuQ6b:&amp;KIrvnb_24|npT2md" jscontroller="YPZw1d#JUcBWd" data-sfc-root="ep" data-wiz-uids="KIrvnb_25,KIrvnb_26" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><div data-ved="2ahUKEwia_t-FuqCXAxVFsFYBHTi9H0cQkIYRegYIAAgPEAE" data-processed="true"><div class="cowzKc" data-processed="true"><div jsuid="KIrvnb_26" class="Uok5Jf" data-processed="true"></div></div><!--qkimaf KIrvnb_24/HugV6--><div class="s88F9c" data-ved="0CAAQyIgRahgKEwjY6srbuaCXAxUAAAAAHQAA