ontroller="OkanJc#hv5sFd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_8m" data-complete="true"><td class="cOeeGf" style="" colspan="undefined" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="QYassd#cLglr" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_8n" data-complete="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_8o" data-complete="true">총계<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></td><td class="cOeeGf" style="" colspan="undefined" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="QYassd#cLglr" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_8p" data-complete="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_8q" data-complete="true">약 4,000,000원 (1인당 200만 원)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></td><td class="cOeeGf" style="" colspan="undefined" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="QYassd#cLglr" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_8r" data-complete="true">비행기 항공권 제외 금액<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></td><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></tr></tbody></table><!--TgQPHd|||[[1,0,0,3,null,&quot;&quot;]]--></div><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;KIrvnb_8s|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_8s" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><blockquote class="lQkWXb" data-animation-nesting="" jsaction="" jscontroller="W2LVve#ZSmpJd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_8t" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style=""><div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_8u" data-hveid="CAAILRAB" data-complete="true">⚠️ <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_8v" data-complete="true">가격 및 운영시간 안내:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> 리조트 숙박 요금, 스파 프로그램 비용, 레스토랑 운영시간 및 메뉴 가격은 여행 시즌(성수기/비수기)과 예약 시점에 따라 변동 폭이 크므로 <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_8w" data-complete="true">[확인 필요]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> 상태입니다. 예약 전 공식 홈페이지나 예약 플랫폼을 통해 반드시 실시간 가격을 재확인하시기 바랍니다.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></blockquote><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;KIrvnb_8x|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_8x" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><hr class="s6NV4e" jsaction="" jscontroller="gWGJ0d#iOlsLd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_8y" data-sfc-pl="|||[]" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style=""><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;KIrvnb_8z|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_8z" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="otQkpb" aria-level="3" role="heading" data-animation-nesting="" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" data-wiz-attrbind="aria-level=KIrvnb_90/fLk2Md" jscontroller="a7qCn#ZxCkTb" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_90" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style="">🚗 이동 계획<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><ul class="KsbFXc U6u95" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="mPWODf#NS0kde" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_91" data-ved="2ahUKEwia_t-FuqCXAxVFsFYBHTi9H0cQ-7AUegYIAAgwEAA" data-hveid="CAAIMBAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_92" data-hveid="CAAIMBAB" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_93" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><div class="JWCOje" data-processed="true"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_94" data-hveid="CAAIMBAC" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_95" data-complete="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_96" data-complete="true">공항 ➡️ 스미냑 (1일 차):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> 클룩(Klook) 등에서 사전 예약한 전용 기사 픽업 서비스 이용. 공항 출구에서 팻말을 든 기사와 미팅하여 안심하고 이동합니다.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_97" data-complete="true"><div class="JWCOje"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_98" data-hveid="CAAIMBAD" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_99" data-complete="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9a" data-complete="true">스미냑 ➡️ 우붓 (3일 차):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> 호텔 체크아웃 시간에 맞춰 한국어 가능 현지 드라이버 차량(10시간 대여)을 호출하여 이동합니다. 이동 중간에 내리지 않고 리조트로 직행하여 체력을 아낍니다.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9b" data-complete="true"><div class="JWCOje"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9c" data-hveid="CAAIMBAE" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9d" data-complete="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9e" data-complete="true">우붓 ➡️ 공항 (5일 차):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> 비행기 출발 4시간 전에 우붓 리조트에서 전용 차량을 타고 공항으로 이동합니다. 우붓 공항 노선은 교통 체증이 심할 수 있으므로 여유 있게 출발합니다.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9f" data-complete="true"><div class="JWCOje"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9g" data-hveid="CAAIMBAF" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9h" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><div class="JWCOje" data-processed="true"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;KIrvnb_9i|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9i" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><hr class="s6NV4e" jsaction="" jscontroller="gWGJ0d#iOlsLd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9j" data-sfc-pl="|||[]" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style=""><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;KIrvnb_9k|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9k" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="otQkpb" aria-level="3" role="heading" data-animation-nesting="" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" data-wiz-attrbind="aria-level=KIrvnb_9l/fLk2Md" jscontroller="a7qCn#ZxCkTb" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9l" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style="">🧳 준비물 리스트<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><ul class="KsbFXc U6u95" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="mPWODf#NS0kde" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9m" data-ved="2ahUKEwia_t-FuqCXAxVFsFYBHTi9H0cQ-7AUegYIAAgzEAA" data-hveid="CAAIMxAA" data-processed="true" data-complete="true"><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9n" data-hveid="CAAIMxAB" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9o" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><div class="JWCOje" data-processed="true"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9p" data-hveid="CAAIMxAC" data-sae="" data-complete="true" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9q" data-complete="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9r" data-complete="true">필수 서류:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> 여권(유효기간 6개월 이상), 발리 전자 도착 비자(e-VOA) 및 전자 세관신고서(QR코드 출력 또는 캡처), 발리 관광세 납부 증명서<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9s" data-complete="true"><div class="JWCOje"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9t" data-hveid="CAAIMxAD" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9u" data-complete="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9v" data-complete="true">의류:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> 수영복 2~3벌, 리조트 룩(원피스, 셔츠), 얇은 가디건(저녁 정글이나 리조트 에어컨 대비), 가벼운 슬리퍼 및 샌들<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9w" data-complete="true"><div class="JWCOje"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9x" data-hveid="CAAIMxAE" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9y" data-complete="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_9z" data-complete="true">전자제품:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> 220V 멀티어댑터(발리는 한국과 플러그가 같으나 일부 리조트는 다를 수 있음), 보조배터리<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_a0" data-complete="true"><div class="JWCOje"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_a1" data-hveid="CAAIMxAF" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_a2" data-complete="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_a3" data-complete="true">스킨케어:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> 자외선 차단제(SPF 50+ 필수), 알로에 수딩젤(진정용), <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_a4" data-complete="true">천연 모기 기피제<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> (우붓 정글 지역 필수)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_a5" data-complete="true"><div class="JWCOje"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_a6" data-hveid="CAAIMxAG" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_a7" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><div class="JWCOje" data-processed="true"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;KIrvnb_a8|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_a8" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><hr class="s6NV4e" jsaction="" jscontroller="gWGJ0d#iOlsLd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_a9" data-sfc-pl="|||[]" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style=""><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;KIrvnb_aa|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_aa" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="otQkpb" aria-level="3" role="heading" data-animation-nesting="" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" data-wiz-attrbind="aria-level=KIrvnb_ab/fLk2Md" jscontroller="a7qCn#ZxCkTb" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_ab" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style="">🚨 주의사항<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><ul class="KsbFXc U6u95" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="mPWODf#NS0kde" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_ac" data-ved="2ahUKEwia_t-FuqCXAxVFsFYBHTi9H0cQ-7AUegYIAAg2EAA" data-hveid="CAAINhAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_ad" data-hveid="CAAINhAB" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_ae" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><div class="JWCOje" data-processed="true"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_af" data-hveid="CAAINhAC" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_ag" data-complete="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_ah" data-complete="true">발리 벨리(Bali Belly) 예방:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> 리조트 내 제공되는 생수(Bottle Water)만 마셔야 하며, 양치질할 때도 생수를 사용하는 것이 안전합니다. 길거리 얼음 음료는 가급적 피하세요.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_ai" data-complete="true"><div class="JWCOje"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_aj" data-hveid="CAAINhAD" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_ak" data-complete="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_al" data-complete="true">관광세 및 비자:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> 발리 입국 시 도착 비자 비용(1인당 500,000 IDR 상당)과 발리 관광세(1인당 150,000 IDR)를 지불해야 합니다. 온라인으로 미리 결제해 두면 공항 대기 시간을 크게 줄일 수 있습니다.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_am" data-complete="true"><div class="JWCOje"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_an" data-hveid="CAAINhAE" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_ao" data-complete="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_ap" data-complete="true">우붓의 모기:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> 정글 리조트는 자연 친화적인 만큼 모기와 벌레가 많습니다. 객실 내 비치된 전자 모기향을 상시 켜두고 외부 활동 시 기피제를 수시로 바르세요.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_aq" data-complete="true"><div class="JWCOje"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_ar" data-hveid="CAAINhAF" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><div class="Jd31eb" jsaction="" jscontroller="r3gopb#L9Jtpd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_as" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><div class="JWCOje" data-processed="true"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;KIrvnb_at|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_at" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><hr class="s6NV4e" jsaction="" jscontroller="gWGJ0d#iOlsLd" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_au" data-sfc-pl="|||[]" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style=""><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;KIrvnb_av|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_av" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="AHmQrc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="LkYPVc#wdvZmf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_aw" data-hveid="CAAIOBAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_ax" data-hveid="CAAIOBAB" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">이 일정은 완벽하게 '쉼'에 초점을 맞추었습니다. 만약 일정 중에 <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_ay" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">우붓 시장 구경<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>이나 <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="KIrvnb_az" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">인생샷 투어(발리 스윙, 사원 투어)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> 같은 가벼운 외부 활동을 한두 개 추가하고 싶으시다면 언제든 말씀해 주세요. 동선을 조정해 드릴게요!<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction=